Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.79,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希宾 明尼苏达州）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.72,0:00:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快带你弟弟离开屋子 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can. Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.83,0:00:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸已经踏上了捕猎之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好几天没回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是爸爸的笔记\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dad's book.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他想让我们继续他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救助他人 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}The family business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得找到爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是现在我唯一想干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing I can think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它通过大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming across the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这是你的本职工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know you're just doing your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但警察一个礼拜之前就来过这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But police have been here all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白为什么还要再询问这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see why we have to go through this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.06,0:02:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事复述了多了 会让他自己也开始相信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more he tells the story, the more he believes it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麦凯太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. McKay…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道你已经向地方当局反映过这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know you spoke with local authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.21,0:02:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但看来这是应该属于是州警局的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this seems like a matter for the state police. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.11,0:02:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以别担心那事听上去多不可思议 埃文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry how crazy it sounds, Evan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道把你所看到的 告诉我们就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just tell us what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.57,0:02:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看电视看到很晚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was up late watching TV…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.99,0:02:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我听见很奇怪的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I heard this weird noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那声音象什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it sound like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.10,0:02:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象怪物发出的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt sounded like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.29,0:02:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他们你在看什么节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the officers what you were watching on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.87,0:02:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「哥斯拉对魔斯拉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godzilla vs. Mothra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.87,0:02:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那部哥斯拉是我最喜欢的一部\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my favorite Godzilla movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 比之前的那部好看多了 - 百分之百的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So much better than the original, huh? - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好象是重新拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He likes the remake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很恐怖的 - 这就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yuck. - That's what I.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:03:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}埃文 你有看见那个到底是什么东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evan, did you see what this thing was?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 但我看见它抓住了詹金先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But I saw it grab Mr. Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.50,0:03:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被那东西推倒在车下\N{\fnArial\fs30}lt pulled him underneath the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他被那怪物拖走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有听见那怪物离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard the monster leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那声音真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made this really scary sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那声音象什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did it sound like, Evan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象鬼魂在哀怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this whining growl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你提供的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此当地警察就没再继续调查这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the local police have not ruled out foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.46,0:03:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然他们已经尽力过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, there were signs of a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们也有可能是对的 可能是起诱拐案件\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they could be right. Could just be a kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能这也不是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this isn't our kind of gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.66,0:03:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能不是的 但看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.68,0:03:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸圈出了这个地方 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for this. Dad marked the area, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注明「可能在这捕杀到攻击人类的幽灵」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possible hunting grounds of a phantom attacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he even do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.49,0:03:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他发现当地有很多关于夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he found a lot of local folklore…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有黑影出没来抓人并消失的民间传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a dark figure that comes out at night grabs people, then vanishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还发现了这\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.97,0:04:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个县失踪人口要远远高出 这个州的其他县\N{\fnArial\fs30}This county has more missing persons per capita than anywhere in the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.61,0:04:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这点很奇怪 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is weird. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.30,0:04:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那幽灵是不是通常在人熟睡时作案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't phantom attackers usually snatch people from their beds?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹金是在停车场被抓走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins was taken from a parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多幽灵都会抓捕人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are all kinds. Spring Heeled Jacks, phantom gassers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.28,0:04:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们时时刻刻都会抓捕人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}They take people anywhere, any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不清楚这到底算不算我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if this is our kind of gig either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的没错 我们明天得查个究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right. We should ask around more tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看见5里外有间汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a motel about five miles back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.80,0:04:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 太好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们去别处逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have another round.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得早点出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get an early start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.81,0:04:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得知道怎么样去找点乐子 大婶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really know how to have fun, don't you, Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.74,0:04:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等下去外面找你 我得先去解决生理问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you outside. I gotta take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.53,0:06:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 你们在这里外面呆了有一个小时了吧 能不能问下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You guys been outside around here in, like, the last hour or so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.26,0:06:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.02,0:07:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.85,0:07:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能为你做些什么么 华盛顿警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what can we do for you, Officer Washington?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在找一个失踪人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working a missing persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道詹金的案子已经归州 警察局管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know the Jenkins case was being covered by state police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.23,0:07:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是这个 我是说另外一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no. No. This is someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.59,0:07:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上那是我堂弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们昨晚还一起在公路边的酒吧里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were having a few last night at this bar by the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我就再没见到过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen him since.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你堂弟是不是喝醉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cousin have a drinking problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说萨姆吗 才喝了两瓶啤酒 他还能唱卡拉OK呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Two beers, and he's doing karaoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.91,0:07:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他肯定没喝醉 他是被人带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't drunk. He was taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.73,0:07:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他姓什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.87,0:07:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要搜索一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the rifle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.51,0:08:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Samuel Winchester."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有个哥哥叫迪恩·温彻斯特 死于圣路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know that his brother, Dean Winchester, died in St. Louis…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是个杀人嫌疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was suspected of murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是叫迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.48,0:08:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是他们家的害群之马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of the black sheep of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但长得还挺英俊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handsome, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.04,0:08:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没在现在的监控上有看到你堂弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not showing up in current reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我到是注意到一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I already have a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到那条公路上有个监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a surveillance camera out by the highway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.74,0:08:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是县交通计算机监视器 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- County traffic cam? - Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.77,0:08:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想那东西应该能拍到 是什么带走了我堂弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking the camera picked up whatever took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者是谁带走了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or whoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.34,0:08:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我联系下那个部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I have access to the cam footage down at the County Works Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与此同时 让我们按照正规手续来办\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, well, in the meantime, let's do this the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你先填一下这个失踪人口表好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you fill out a missing persons report…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:08:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就坐那边填吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sit tight over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警官 他的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer, look, he's family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托我务必看好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of look out for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以让我帮你一起找他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta let me go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.76,0:09:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 我不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你们县的失踪者中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your county has its fair share of missing persons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.75,0:09:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有找回来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of them come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.15,0:09:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆的失踪我也有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以得必须找回他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格雷格 我想我找些线索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greg. I think we got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.83,0:10:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}计算机监控器每3秒钟拍摄图象一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}These traffic cams take an image every three seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拍摄图象一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the Amber Alert program.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.33,0:10:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这些图象是在你堂弟失踪的 那段时间里拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These images were all taken around the time your cousin disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要的不是这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This really isn't what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.01,0:10:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下在下结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait. Wait. Next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一张 这张就是萨姆离开酒吧时拍到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one was taken right after Sam left the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看那东西的后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the back end of that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再看看那牌照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look at the plates.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.53,0:10:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那牌照看上去很新 这车可能是偷来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plates look new. It was probably stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.52,0:10:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以那个换上新牌照的贼 肯定与你堂弟的失踪有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whoever's driving that rust bucket must be involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.70,0:10:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到的引擎声了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear that engine?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.94,0:11:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点象鬼魂的哀怨 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of a whining growl, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是有点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.86,0:11:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我非常讨厌这个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.73,0:11:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.48,0:11:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看我还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it look like l'm doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.85,0:11:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想可能在乡村 有乡村的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}The country, I think. Smells like the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是詹金吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Alvin Jenkins, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.97,0:11:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.05,0:11:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗯 - 那你这次的营救看来没有成效\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well - no offense, but this is a piss poor rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我兄弟还在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother's out there right now too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他正在找我们 因此…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's looking for us. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他就能找到我们是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he's not gonna find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们根本不知道自己在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the middle of nowhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.12,0:12:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不知道他们会对我们怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for them to come back and do God knows what to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们是什么物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.93,0:12:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到过它们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever grabbed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.20,0:12:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们看上去象什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}管好你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别碰我 别抓我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you touch me. You leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它们是人类 - 是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're just people. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:12:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你以为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们多久才给你吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How often do they feed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.73,0:13:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们用那东西打开笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey use that thing over there to open the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是唯一你能看到他们的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's the only time you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太远了 但我在等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far. But l'm waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等待什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下顿毒打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ned Beatty time, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想那是你最担心的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think that's the least of your worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 你认为他们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - What do you think they want, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那得看他们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是群有精神病的农民\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a bunch of psycho, hillbilly rednecks, you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你觉得不对 那你看看四周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for love in all the wrong places.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.64,0:13:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一个交通监视器离这里有50里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. The next traffic cam…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你记得事发地不在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 50 miles from here and your pickup didn't pass that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他们肯定在其他地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… lt must have pulled off somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.95,0:13:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这里我没看见有路啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't see any other roads here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.01,0:13:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里还有许多路没有开垦过\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of these backwoods properties have their own private roads.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.59,0:13:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Gregory?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.70,0:14:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我查了你的工号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ran your badge number.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.47,0:14:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们与州立警察合作时的惯例\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's routine when working a case with state police…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.87,0:14:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为的是了解你的身份和工作任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}for accounting purposes, and what have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们反馈给我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, they just got back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.20,0:14:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说你的工号被盗用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Says here your badge was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有这是你的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's a picture of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我减肥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost some weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.71,0:14:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我得了象迈克尔·杰克逊样的皮肤病\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got that Michael Jackson skin disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你下车一下好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Would you step out of the car, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你如果想要逮捕我 那没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to arrest me? That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 我会合作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cooperate, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.41,0:14:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你得先让我找到萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, please, let me find Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我根本不知道你是谁即使萨姆失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know who you are.Or if this Sam person is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着我的眼睛 你觉得我是在说慌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look in my eyes and tell me I'm lying about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.03,0:15:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}证件被偷了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identity theft?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是一个无证警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're impersonating an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我们都年幼的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were young…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有一次差点把他推入火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}l pretty much pulled him from a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后从那起 我觉得我有亏欠于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ever since then, I've felt responsible for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在的职责就是保证他的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like it's my job to keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是担心如果不快点找到他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just afraid if we don't find him fast…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.53,0:15:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.35,0:15:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 你让我很难办\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've given me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.61,0:15:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我们找到萨姆·温彻斯特后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to take you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.87,0:15:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不得不逮捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we find Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.94,0:16:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放弃吧 萨姆 不可能逃出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you give it up, Sammy. There's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会放弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.21,0:16:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.49,0:16:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}支架\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bracket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.86,0:16:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天那 是个支架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God, a bracket.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在能够的到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we got them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太短了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have been a short.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能你把一些东西敲松了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you knocked something loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你还是呆在这里好\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think you should get back in, Jenkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.13,0:16:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你说什么 - 这才是正确的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想离开这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.89,0:16:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想 但是光这样不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that was too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我离开后去找援助 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna send help. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别那样 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹金 这可能是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins. This might be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.74,0:16:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.48,0:17:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我并不是想得寸进尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I don't mean to press my luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么事你说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your luck is so pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.03,0:19:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么会帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are you helping me out anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不直接铐了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just lock me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我兄弟三年前也失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Riley disappeared three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就象萨姆一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot like Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到处找他但没有结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We searched for him, but nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.51,0:19:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我了解那种感到对别人的安全 有责任的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it's like to feel responsible for someone, and for them…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.35,0:19:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 让我们继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait. Pull over here. Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这里开始就是岔道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the first turn off I've seen so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.89,0:20:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你呆在这里 我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay here. I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.77,0:20:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.75,0:20:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不是警察 而且还是带罪之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a civilian. And a felon, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.19,0:20:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我不能带着你继续了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not taking you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去哪里都得和我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.56,0:20:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得答应我你不会擅自行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise you won't get involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.63,0:20:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来处理这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.26,0:20:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shake on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这太可笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯瑟琳 我想你是需要我的帮助的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kathleen, I think you're gonna need my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能行 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll manage, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来以后得带点回形针在身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta start carrying paperclips.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.75,0:21:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}房子里面有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.31,0:22:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是凯瑟琳 我是代理治安长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Kathleen, I'm a deputy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.37,0:22:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米西 这个名字不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy. That's a pretty name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.97,0:22:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米西 你妈妈在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy, is your mom home?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.02,0:22:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 那你爸爸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What about your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.23,0:22:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们进来看一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I come in for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想让你认一下这个照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to look at a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.11,0:22:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有看见过这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看这照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.13,0:22:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他好象受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米西 小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy, sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你哥哥我想见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}go tell your brothers I wanna see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.54,0:23:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就差一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.89,0:24:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从没见过他如此震怒过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l've never seen him so angry before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.27,0:24:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还从没被就警察跟踪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Lee, never been followed by the police before.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.51,0:24:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是萨姆·温彻斯特吗 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Sam Winchester? Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.06,0:24:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.46,0:24:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的堂兄在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cousings looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.53,0:24:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:24:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.95,0:25:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.66,0:25:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他铐在我车上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cuffed him to my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.66,0:25:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.04,0:25:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.36,0:25:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.28,0:25:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见到你太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.63,0:25:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么打开手铐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out of the cuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.83,0:25:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我还有点小伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a trick or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.61,0:25:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.71,0:25:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这些看上去 他们真的很残忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}These locks look like they're gonna be a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.11,0:25:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那里是自动控制门\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some kind of automatic control right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.26,0:25:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到过他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen them?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.16,0:25:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.Dude. They're just people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.72,0:25:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们打过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they jumped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.82,0:26:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那门看上去好象锈掉了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be getting a little rusty there, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.16,0:26:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.19,0:26:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们让詹金逃走了 但我想那是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}They let Jenkins go, but that was some sort of trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.75,0:26:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这个对我无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make any sense to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.71,0:26:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, that's the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.39,0:26:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们和我们以前遇到的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, with our usual playmates, there's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们只是疯狂的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}But with people, they're just crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.61,0:26:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这之外有看到其他东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See anything else out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.81,0:26:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有很多车藏在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's a dozen junked cars out back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.10,0:26:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想每次他们抓一个人来 顺便把他的车也一起抢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they take someone, they take their car too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.90,0:26:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有看到过一只10岁左右的野马吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see a black Mustang? About 1 0 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.31,0:26:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, actually I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.18,0:26:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你兄弟的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.50,0:26:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.26,0:26:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里还真是个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.30,0:26:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得好好教训下他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}out and take care of those bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.28,0:26:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个需要钥匙 有钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing takes a key? Key?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.87,0:26:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好吧 我会找到它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I better go find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.72,0:26:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.81,0:26:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.78,0:26:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.78,0:27:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.48,0:28:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就说嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll say it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.61,0:28:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我找到元凶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons, I get.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里人都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.24,0:29:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.80,0:30:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.82,0:30:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.70,0:30:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爸爸 - 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! - Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.88,0:30:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.03,0:30:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.13,0:31:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得先把你揍扁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kick your ass first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.54,0:31:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.50,0:31:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们把他关起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's hunt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.81,0:31:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 这家伙很会打架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, this one's a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.75,0:31:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来把他关起来的乐趣还不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure would be fun to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.44,0:31:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定在和我开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.40,0:31:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你们的职业\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what this is about. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是猎捕人类吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yahoos hunt people?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.89,0:32:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你早该死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever killed before?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.29,0:32:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.84,0:32:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那得看你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that depends on what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.23,0:32:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一辈子都在猎捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hunted all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.77,0:32:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像我的父亲和祖父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like my father, his before him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.44,0:32:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猎捕熊和鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've hunted deer and bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.53,0:32:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有次捕到了美洲狮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even got a cougar once. Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.98,0:32:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但最棒的猎物是… 人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the best hunt is human.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.82,0:32:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有什么比的上这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's nothing like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.40,0:32:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把他们的命掌控自己的手上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding their life in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.63,0:32:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看着他们眼神中的恐惧 这让你感到活力无穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing the fear in their eyes just before they go dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.78,0:32:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a sick puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.17,0:32:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们给他们武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We give them a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.39,0:32:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们给他们有反抗的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give them a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.23,0:33:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种猎捕人类就向一种传统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of like our tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.81,0:33:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从父辈传给小辈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Passed down father to son.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.88,0:33:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然每年就捕一到两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Course, only one or two a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从不过多来引起政府的注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never enough to bring the law down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.19,0:33:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还不至于受到他们的「照顾」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never been that sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.14,0:33:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别太低估自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yeah, well, don't sell yourself short.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们引起的骚动不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're plenty sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.66,0:33:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此你才和那漂亮的警察一起来 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you with that pretty cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.98,0:33:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.60,0:33:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I tell you…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.68,0:33:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得答应我别把我 扔进那火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}you promise not to make me into an ashtray?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.17,0:33:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让你还呆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only reason I don't let my boys take you right here and now…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.36,0:33:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就说明我还有问题要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that there's something I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.23,0:33:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 那我就告诉你 别跟你姐姐结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how about it's not nice to marry your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.69,0:33:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.28,0:34:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 还会有警察来找你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any other cops gonna come looking for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.48,0:34:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那吃了我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.08,0:34:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不不 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.97,0:34:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能真的会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You actually might.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.96,0:34:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这很有趣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.84,0:34:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给我们家带来了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought this down on my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.40,0:34:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你想玩游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play games?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.28,0:34:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们就来玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll play some games.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.80,0:34:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们 看来我们晚上我们还有场猎要打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we're gonna have a hunt tonight, after all, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.45,0:34:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你来选猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you get to pick the animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.68,0:34:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是那个小子还是那警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy or the cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.43,0:34:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wait, wait, wait. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.02,0:34:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人会来找我 只有我们三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. Nobody's coming for me, all right? It's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.82,0:34:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不选 那我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't choose, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.00,0:34:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.81,0:35:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次 我会对准眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, I'll take an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.46,0:35:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我选那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. The guy, the guy, take the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.12,0:35:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}李 马上去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.86,0:35:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别让他出笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.14,0:35:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直接在笼子里杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him in the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.23,0:35:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.38,0:35:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得你说过只是猎捕他而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna hunt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.05,0:35:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还会给他逃跑的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna give him a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.45,0:35:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}李 你杀了那小子之后 再杀了那婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee, when you're done with the boy, shoot the bitch too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.40,0:35:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在警察来之前 你得把那清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta clean up this mess up before any more cops come running out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.67,0:35:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.96,0:36:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你杀了我兄弟 我发誓肯定会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hurt my brother, I'll kill you, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会把你们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.75,0:36:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会把你们全杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.77,0:36:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.72,0:36:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.66,0:36:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贾里德 你和我一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jared, you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.10,0:36:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}米西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missy…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.44,0:36:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}you watch him, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.13,0:36:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}李 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.62,0:36:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.99,0:36:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的 贾里德 开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Jared, get the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.01,0:37:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保险丝被弄断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have pulled the fuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.28,0:38:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这个婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.70,0:39:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看着他 你先走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch this one. You go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.61,0:39:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.80,0:39:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你伤了我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.25,0:39:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要杀了你 臭婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna bleed you, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.75,0:39:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.19,0:39:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.93,0:39:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.77,0:39:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me why.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.37,0:39:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.78,0:40:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那女孩在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.94,0:40:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}被锁在壁橱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked in the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.12,0:40:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她爸爸怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.03,0:40:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我杀了他 快逃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot. Trying to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.35,0:40:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想车在警察局那\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think the car's at the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.66,0:40:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}呼叫后援\N{\fnArial\fs30}backup units en route to your location.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.62,0:40:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.61,0:40:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}州警察局和FBI的人一个小时就会到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}state police and the FBI are gonna be here within the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.14,0:40:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们想要和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna wanna talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.51,0:41:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我建议你们最好和他们说明下情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest that you're both long gone by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.05,0:41:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.07,0:41:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不想冒犯你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to press our luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.60,0:41:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们不能在这里久留\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.65,0:41:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到哪里可以搭顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we could catch a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.02,0:41:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这一直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.50,0:41:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果看见巡逻车的话就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck if you see a squad car.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.60,0:41:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听起来不错 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound great to me. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.11,0:41:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你兄弟的事很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen sorry about your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.62,0:41:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.00,0:41:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当知道他发生了什么事 真的很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was really hard not knowing what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.42,0:41:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想当我知道事实的时候 会轻松一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it would be easier once I knew the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.17,0:41:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但… 并不是那么容易接受得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… lt isn't, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.55,0:41:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么样 你们可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.60,0:42:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但别在干那事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.95,0:42:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.24,0:42:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像你那样失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go missing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.67,0:42:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在担心我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.82,0:42:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是你再象这样失踪 我也不会再来找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is, you vanish like that again, l'm not looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.56,0:42:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还是会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.22,0:42:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你才会被那13岁女孩看着 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got sidelined by a thirteen year olds girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.48,0:42:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.58,0:42:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}闭嘴 只是开开玩笑 你那里是不是生锈了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just saying, you're getting rusty, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.13,0:42:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
